- **`doCsiDollar`** (~120 lines) — DECCRA/DECFRA/DECERA/DECSERA/DECCARA/DECRARA rectangular area operations
- **`doCsiDoubleQuote`** — DECSCA (character attribute protection)
- **`doCsiSingleQuote`** — DECIC/DECDC (insert/delete columns)
- **`doCsiQuestionMarkArgDollar`** — DECRQM (request private mode setting)
- **`doCsiArgsSpace`** — DECSCUSR (cursor style) + margin-bell volume
- **`doCsiArgsAsterix`** — DECSACE (attribute change extent)

